      "to": "places this secret [lives](/lˈɪvz/)",
      "why": "Noun-noun reading; force verb stress."
    },
    {
      "from": "secret usually live",
      "to": "secret usually [live](/lˈɪv/)",
      "why": "Kokoro picks the adjective 'lyve'; force the verb 'liv'."
    },
